<h1>Predictive Analytics for Small Business: 7 Use Cases You Can Start With in 2026</h1>
<p class="meta">By Tycoon Clap · Published October 19, 2026 · 10 min read</p>

<div class="summary">
<strong>Quick answer:</strong> Predictive analytics uses your past data to estimate what is likely to happen next. Small businesses can start with seven practical uses: sales forecasting, demand and inventory planning, customer churn, lead scoring, customer lifetime value, marketing spend planning and cash flow. You do not need a data science team. You need clean historical data, one clear question, and a simple tool such as Excel or Power BI.
</div>

